# What `gcloud run deploy --source .` uploads. Without this file gcloud derives
# its ignore list from .gitignore, and .gitignore hides eval/runs/*.json (the run
# records are hand-committed with `git add -f`) — so the scoreboard's records
# never reached the image. The answer keys are excluded here AND in .dockerignore.
.git/
.venv/
venv/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.env
workspace/
audit/
data/
eval/answer_keys/
